GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 113(3) the register must contain a statement of the shares held by each member` MEANS
    IF `the company has a share capital`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "In the case of a company having a share capital" ("in the case of" counts as "where": ruling of 2026-11-05 (b))

